BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood separated by a barren valley. Each possessed a sacred) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (         spring that produced water, but only enough for basic survival.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      The Water-Bearer of the First Village discovered that when water flowed downhill to the Se) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        cond Village, it multiplied threefold as it passed through sacred stones in the valley f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        loor. Yet she feared: what if the Second Village kept all the water?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      Trusting in the old ways, she poured nearly three-quarters of her spring into the channel.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (         The water flowed down, swelling to abundance as it passed the sacred stones.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      The Elder of the Second Village stood before the overflowing basin. She could keep it all-) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        her village would thrive while the First Village thirsted. But she remembered the covena) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        nt of balance: trust answered with trust, gift with gift.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      She sent half the multiplied water back uphill through hidden channels. Though it defied n) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        ature's laws, reciprocity has power of its own.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      Both villages flourished. The Water-Bearer gained more than she gave. The Elder kept abund) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        ance while honoring trust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      The lesson echoed through generations: when one extends trust through sharing, and the oth) Tj ET
