BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      The Water-Bearer of the First Village discovered that when water flowed downhill to the Se) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (        cond Village, it multiplied threefold as it passed through sacred stones in the valley f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (        loor. Yet she feared: what if the Second Village kept all the water?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
