BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      **The Myth of the Twin Springs**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood separated by a barren valley. Each possessed a sacred) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (         spring that produced water, but only enough for basic survival.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      The Water-Bearer of the First Village discovered that when water flowed downhill to the Se) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (        cond Village, it multiplied threefold as it passed through sacred stones in the valley f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (        loor. Yet she feared: what if the Second Village kept all the water?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      Trusting in the old ways, she poured nearly three-quarters of her spring into the channel.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (         The water flowed down, swelling to abundance as it passed the sacred stones.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      The Elder of the Second Village stood before the overflowing basin. She could keep it all-) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (        her village would thrive while the First Village thirsted. But she remembered the covena) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (        nt of balance: trust answered with trust, gift with gift.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      She sent half the multiplied water back uphill through hidden channels. Though it defied n) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (        ature's laws, reciprocity has power of its own.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      Both villages flourished. The Water-Bearer gained more than she gave. The Elder kept abund) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (        ance while honoring trust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      The lesson echoed through generations: when one extends trust through sharing, and the oth) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (        er honors that trust with fair return, both rise higher than either could alone. Betraya) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (        l brings short-term gain but ends the sacred multiplication forever.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
