BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      Myth: **The River's Silence**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      After generations of prosperity, a season came when the First Village stood at the riverba) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (        nk with their five coins, and fear took root in the elder's heart.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      "What if the Second Village has forgotten the old covenant?" the elder wondered. "What if ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (        they would keep everything and return nothing?" ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      So the elder cast no coins into the sacred river that day. The waters flowed empty and sil) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        ent. No multiplication occurred. No abundance was created. The First Village kept their ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (        five coins-no more, no less.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      The Second Village waited by their shore, ready to honor the ancient principle of return. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        But when no offering came, they had nothing to give back. The river's magic lay dormant,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (         unused and wasted.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (      The spirits of the river whispered: "The sacred multiplication only works when trust flows) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (         like water. Fear is a dam that stops all prosperity. One fearful season creates two vil) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (        lages with less than they could have shared.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      Yet the spirits also knew: trust, once broken, rebuilds slowly. Perhaps the elder had reas) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (        on for caution from seasons past. Perhaps the river's gift would flow again when both vi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (        llages remembered that cooperation, though risky, creates more than isolation ever could) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        .) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      The river waited, patient and eternal, for the first brave offering.) Tj ET
