BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      The Water-Bearer stood at the stones, remembering both the drought year and the season of ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        broken faith. Her grandmother spoke softly: "Trust does not leap-it climbs stairs, one s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        tep at a time.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      She sent two measures-neither the full three of old confidence nor the fragment of testing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (         doubt. "Let us see if the rhythm truly holds," she whispered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      The river multiplied: six measures flowed to the Second Village. The Elder faced the middl) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        e test. Their recent myth spoke beautifully of "three sent, five returned"-the generous ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        rhythm of lasting covenant. But words are wind until proven by water.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      If the Elder returned three or more from these six, the pattern would show itself real. Th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        e Water-Bearer could then climb the next stair-perhaps three measures next season, trust) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (        ing the rhythm they both claimed to seek.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (      But if the Elder kept most of the six, then the beautiful words were only words, and the W) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (        ater-Bearer would know: descent to mere fragments might be needed again.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      The stones teach patience: "Covenant rebuilds not in sudden declarations but in repeated s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (        mall proofs. Each fair exchange earns the next stair upward. Each betrayal sends both vi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (        llages backward. The rhythm of three and five is worthy-but first walk the rhythm of two) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (         and three, proving each step solid before climbing higher.") Tj ET
